  "quest.83F16EF11413E1F9.quest_desc": [
    "Chicken Nest — a item from the Farming for Blockheads mod.",
    "",
    "Farming for Blockheads adds the Market and farming staples so you can buy seeds and animals instead of praying the center block rolls wheat.",
    "",
    "How to make it:",
    "• Craft it in a shaped pattern — open JEI and search the item for the exact grid layout.",
    "",
    "Skyblock tip: your random center block may eventually roll the parts — stash duplicates in storage until you have the full recipe."
  ],
